# This repo is a Unity Package (UPM). If you drop it into an existing
# Unity project instead, use Unity's standard project .gitignore for
# Library/, Temp/, Obj/, Build/, etc. This file covers package-local junk.

*.meta.bak
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user

# Secrets — never commit real keys, even in a settings asset override file.
**/AIProviderSettings.local.asset
.env
